Lundgren, Karen; Burrows, Francis J.; Mansfield, Robert; Timony, Gregg
A.; Ulm, Edgar H.; Kasibhatla, Srinivas R.; Boehm, Marcus F.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Medicinal Chemistry (2006), 49(17), 5352-5362

