1H-NMR(400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.33 (s, 1H), 7.30-7.22 (m, 4H), 7.16-7.12(m,
3H), 4.91 (s, 1H), 4.86 (s, 1H), 4.74 (td, J = 6.8, 2.2 Hz, 1H), 2.38(d,
J = 6.8 Hz, 2H), 2.34 (s, 3H), 2.12(d, J = 2.2 Hz, 1H), 1.77(s, 3H);
